<style>
/* viewport 640x400 */
.column { width: 220px; }
.small { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.5; }
.mono { font-family: "Geist Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; }
.row { display: flex; }
.label { background-color: #eee; }
</style>

<div class="column">
  <h1>Retouching</h1>
  <p>Curves, levels and a white point set from a neutral sample, applied as layers you can turn off.</p>
  <p class="small">Each adjustment is a layer with its own mask, and every value the agent sets is shown so you can check it.</p>
  <h3>Readouts</h3>
  <div class="mono">R 238 G 231 B 222 at x 1024 y 768</div>
  <div class="row"><div class="label">Exposure</div><div>+0.35 EV</div></div>
</div>
